# Everything below is optional. With no .env at all the agent runs on bundled
# fixtures and writes its reviewer notes with the deterministic explainer.

# Set this to have the LLM write the reviewer note instead of the template.
# It changes the WORDING only. Scores and routing come from the rules and are
# asserted identical under both explainers in test/explain.test.ts.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Model used for the reviewer note. Default: claude-haiku-4-5-20251001
# RISK_EXPLAINER_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5-20251001

# Score at which an order stops being released automatically (default 25),
# and the score above which it is flagged urgent (default 55).
# RISK_REVIEW_THRESHOLD=25
# RISK_HOLD_THRESHOLD=55
